   "note": "FARM (scripts/companion/farm_job.gd): break ground for a new bed while the household has fewer than it keeps round home (HouseholdCrew.beds_wanted, the Tasks tab), finish breaking one, hoe the weeds out of a growing bed. It feeds the sowing (feeds: the worked beds are its ground; the sowing is fed from outside too: the player's own beds), so the fields' pull reaches it."
